Cell["\<\
phi is symmetric, and GG is symmetric in its last two slots. Here phi is \
treated as a tensor with respect to background coordinate transformations. \
Its nonlinear metric-density gauge transformation is not needed for the \
algebraic comparison. Lowering or raising indices is always performed with \
eta.\
\>", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"407dbc5e-e452-4a61-9f81-1cad4e905634"],

Cell[CellGroupData[{

