Cell["\<\
The substitution kappa -> -2 below illustrates the numerical relative factor \
only; it is not a physical value of the coupling and does not change its \
definition. The definitive comparison keeps kappa symbolic in \
clmCubicResidual below.\
\>", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"1f022307-f403-4960-b348-ecb6bda4f6ce"],

